      "text": "Amblyopia"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ": visual decrease in one or both eyes (functional visual impairment) d/t a developmental vision disorder during early childhood"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
