       {
        "type": "underline",
        "attrs": {
         "style": "single"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "PATHO"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ": one or both eyes convey poor or mismatched visual information to the brain ⇢ brain suppresses information from one or both eyes ⇢ disuse of the eye ⇢ lacking visual stimuli w/ partial underdevelopment of "
